[[0,917058,0,6,1,5,"2016-03-13T13:45:17","ot_to_know","",[],"<p>We have a teacher that is shaving her head today. Would love to put her donations over the top. She's at 6750 right now and her extended goal was 7000. If there's some interest I will add the link. Thanks!!</p>\n<p>Edit: Degenerate adding link now </p>\n<p>https://www.stbaldricks.org/participants/mypage/829302/2016\n</p>","If I asked for you to donate to a st baldricks campaign, would you?","","AskVoat"],[1,4589796,0,2,0,2,"2016-03-13T14:17:15","bob_dobalina","",[],"<p>I don't understand why she's shaving her head to raise money. Why can't people give to charity, medical research and other such things without requiring someone to shave their heads or grow beards ?</p>"],[2,4589946,4589796,0,0,0,"2016-03-13T14:51:05","ot_to_know","",[],"<p>Best answer I can give is community rallying. The school, the kids, friends, family and the community have come together to bring awareness. Though cancer is not something to be made light off, everyone has had and will have a good time watching a teacher get her head shaved. They also raised a good amount of money. </p>"],[1,4589871,0,2,0,2,"2016-03-13T14:35:31","un_salamandre","",[],"<p>Who's saint Baldrick?</p>"],[2,4589972,4589871,0,0,0,"2016-03-13T14:56:03","ot_to_know","",[],"<p><a href=\"http://www.stbaldricks.org\">http://www.stbaldricks.org</a></p>"],[1,4589905,0,2,0,2,"2016-03-13T14:41:52","fnork","",[],"<p>If I asked you to donate $1000 to my Friday night beer fund, would your answer to that question be the same as your answer to this question?</p>"],[2,4589961,4589905,0,0,0,"2016-03-13T14:53:43","ot_to_know","",[],"<p>I'd like to donate towards your beer fund, I'm always in for a good time but I donated it to cancer research instead. That's all I have for now. </p>"],[3,4590674,4589961,3,0,3,"2016-03-13T16:58:39","MrPim","",[],"<p>Your priorities are all fucked up man.</p>"],[1,4590015,0,0,0,0,"2016-03-13T15:04:34","middle_path","",[],"<p>No, but I'm poor af. </p>"],[1,4590160,0,2,0,2,"2016-03-13T15:31:29","un_salamandre","",[],"<p>Allright, they've got a good score on <a href=\"http://www.charitynavigator.org/index.cfm?bay=search.summary&amp;orgid=12540#.VuV3aJwrKhc\">Charity Navigator</a>, I've donated.</p>"],[2,4590221,4590160,0,0,0,"2016-03-13T15:43:58","ot_to_know","",[],"<p>Thank you!!</p>"]]
